// Title: Windows Hypervisor Enforced Code Integrity Disabled
// Rule ID: 8b7273a4-ba5d-4d8a-b04f-11f2900d043a
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1562.001
// Category: registry_set
// Product: windows
